    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0411.diabolos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0411.diabolos.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0411_diabolos">
        <head>ΔΙΑΒΟΛΟΣ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-1">
          <head>I.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-1-l1">Καὶ κλείεθ᾽ ἡ θύρα μοχλοῖς· ἀλλ᾽ οὐδὲ εἷς</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-1-l2">τέκτων ὀχυρὰν οὕτως ἐποίησεν θύραν,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-1-l3">δι᾽ ἧς γαλῆ καὶ μοιχὸς οὐκ εἰσέρχεται.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. VI 28. Vs. 1 abest καὶ a cod. A.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2-l1">Μέγα,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2-l2">ὦ Φορμίων, γλωττόκομον, οὐκ ὀφθαλμιῶ.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Pollux X 154: οὐ μὴν ἀλλὰ καὶ ἐπὶ τοῦ ἀγγείου γλωττόκομον (ita Nunnesius pro γλωττοκομεῖον) παρὰ τοῖς νεωτέροις ἔστιν εὑρεῖν, ὡς — καὶ ἐν Ἀπολλοδώρου τοῦ Καρυστίου Διαβόλῳ Μέγα κτλ.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Legebatur ὀφθαλμῷ. Correxit Jungermannus. Lobeckius ad Phrynich. p. 99 Apollodori versum ita scriptum affert: <quote>
              <lg>
                <l n="1_2" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2-l1_2">μέγ᾽ ὁ Φορμίων γλωττόκομον, οὐκ ὀφθαλμιῶ.</l>
              </lg>
            </quote>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2_2">
          <head>ΔΙΑΒΟΛΟΣ</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2_2-l1">Forem vecte oppilamus: at nemo interim</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2_2-l2">adeo obseratam ianuam fecit faber,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0411-diabolos-2_2-l3">quae non feli pateret atque adultero.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
